---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Preview — Blackbook Racing Club"
  description="A preview of what Club and Blackbook subscribers see. The daily slate, the seasonal blackbook of horses to track, and the weekly editorial — illustrated with sample content."
>
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Preview</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">What members see</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Club and Blackbook tiers don't open for paid signup until launch. These samples show the
      format and substance of each deliverable. Numbers and horses below are illustrative — the
      live ledger has the real ones.
    </p>

    <!-- ====== Club: daily slate ====== -->
    <section class="preview-section">
      <header class="section-head">
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge-club">Club</span>
        <h2>The daily slate</h2>
        <p class="section-pitch">
          Pre-off picks delivered to a private Telegram channel each evening, then reconciled
          to Betfair Starting Price the next morning. Same format every day.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="telegram-mock">
        <div class="tg-head">▲ BLACKBOOK CLUB SLATE <span class="bar">|</span> 2026-05-04</div>
        <div class="tg-meta">Tomorrow <span class="dot">·</span> 5 picks <span class="dot">·</span> 1pt @ Betfair SP</div>
        <div class="tg-list">
          <div class="tg-pick">
            <div class="tg-when">13:55 PONTEFRACT <span class="code">FLT</span></div>
            <div class="tg-horse">SILVER ARROW</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tg-pick">
            <div class="tg-when">14:30 KEMPTON (A.W) <span class="code">AWF</span></div>
            <div class="tg-horse">DAWN HORIZON</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tg-pick">
            <div class="tg-when">15:05 UTTOXETER <span class="code">CHS</span></div>
            <div class="tg-horse">GLENMORE</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tg-pick">
            <div class="tg-when">15:25 BEVERLEY <span class="code">FLT</span></div>
            <div class="tg-horse">NORTHERN SCRIBE</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tg-pick">
            <div class="tg-when">15:45 PONTEFRACT <span class="code">FLT</span></div>
            <div class="tg-horse">EMERALD ISLE</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tg-foot">Logged 18:42 BST <span class="dot">·</span> pre-off <span class="dot">·</span> team-reviewed</div>
        <div class="tg-foot quiet">Reconciled tomorrow morning at BSP.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====== Blackbook: horses to track ====== -->
    <section class="preview-section">
      <header class="section-head">
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge-blackbook">Blackbook</span>
        <h2>Horses to track</h2>
        <p class="section-pitch">
          A working list of horses we've flagged across multiple runs and expect to fire when
          conditions align. Each entry has a reason and a target run window. Updated through
          the season.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="bb-entry">
        <div class="bb-head">
          <span class="mark">▲</span>
          <span class="bb-name">ATLANTIC CROSSING</span>
        </div>
        <p class="bb-bio">4yo bay gelding <span class="dot">·</span> Trainer A.B. Smith <span class="dot">·</span> Owner: Smith Bloodstock</p>
        <div class="bb-flags">
          <p>
            <strong>First flagged 2026-04-17</strong> — finished 4th of 12 at Wetherby, beaten
            ~2L. Held up off a hot pace, made up four lengths from the home turn.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Second flag 2026-04-29</strong> — finished 2nd of 9 at Doncaster, just
            held off by a Group-class finisher. Master rating +3lb LTO. Now likely off OR-92
            for a long-distance handicap.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="bb-why">
          <span class="bb-label">Why on the list</span>
          Showing strong sectionals over 11f, but the form lines suggest 12-13f on testing
          ground is the proper trip. Yard has shown patience with him since debut.
        </p>
        <div class="bb-target">
          <div><span class="bb-label">Target window</span> next 30 days <span class="dot">·</span> 11-13f <span class="dot">·</span> soft / heavy</div>
          <div><span class="bb-label">Status</span> pending — flag a third time and we'll back at the right trip.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====== Blackbook: weekly editorial ====== -->
    <section class="preview-section">
      <header class="section-head">
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge-blackbook">Blackbook</span>
        <h2>Weekly editorial</h2>
        <p class="section-pitch">
          A members-only piece each Monday — what the slate did, where the methodology
          surprised us, and what we're watching next. First paragraph below; the rest is for
          subscribers.
        </p>
      </header>

      <article class="editorial-mock">
        <p class="ed-eyebrow">The week's verdict</p>
        <h3 class="ed-title">2026-05-04 → 2026-05-10</h3>
        <p class="ed-byline">By the team</p>
        <div class="ed-body">
          <p>
            The slate produced 14 picks at <strong>+12.4pt</strong>, with the headline run a
            14.0 winner at Lingfield on Wednesday on master-form. Two tighter losing days
            bookended a strong middle of the week, and the Blackbook flagged a fourth horse
            in the spring 11-13f cohort we've been watching since Newbury Trials weekend.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="paywall">
          <p class="paywall-eyebrow">Blackbook members only</p>
          <p class="paywall-text">
            The full piece breaks down each pick, the methodology adjustments after the
            losing days, and the four-horse cohort we expect to start firing in the next
            three weeks.
          </p>
          <a class="paywall-cta" href="/subscribe">View tiers →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <p class="cta-text">
        Open is free in Telegram. Club and Blackbook open for paid signup at launch.
      </p>
      <a class="cta-btn" href="/subscribe">Compare tiers →</a>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .page {
      padding-top: 16px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 40px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .lede {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 72px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .preview-section {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 72px;
    }

    .preview-section + .preview-section {
      padding-top: 56px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .section-head .tier-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-pitch {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .tier-badge {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tier-badge-club {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    .tier-badge-blackbook {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* === Club: telegram-style daily slate mock === */
    .telegram-mock {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--cream);
      padding: 32px 36px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-feature-settings: 'tnum';
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .tg-head {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .tg-head .bar {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.45);
      margin: 0 6px;
    }

    .tg-meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.78);
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .tg-meta .dot,
    .tg-foot .dot {
      margin: 0 6px;
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .tg-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .tg-pick {
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.12);
    }

    .tg-pick:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .tg-when {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.7);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .tg-when .code {
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .tg-horse {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    .tg-foot {
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.18);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.7);
    }

    .tg-foot.quiet {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.5);
      padding-top: 4px;
      border-top: none;
    }

    /* === Blackbook: horse entry === */
    .bb-entry {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--cream);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);
    }

    .bb-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .bb-head .mark {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .bb-name {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .bb-bio {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--ink-mute);
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .bb-bio .dot,
    .bb-target .dot {
      margin: 0 6px;
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .bb-flags {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .bb-flags p {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .bb-flags p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .bb-why {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .bb-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .bb-target {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .bb-target .bb-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      vertical-align: 1px;
    }

    .bb-target div {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* === Editorial mock === */
    .editorial-mock {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .ed-eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ed-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ed-byline {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-mute);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .ed-body {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .paywall {
      padding: 28px 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .paywall-eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .paywall-text {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
    }

    .paywall-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--cream);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* === Final CTA === */
    .cta-section {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-text {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--cream);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page-title {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .lede {
        font-size: 17px;
        margin-bottom: 56px;
      }

      .telegram-mock {
        padding: 24px 22px;
      }

      .tg-horse {
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      .bb-entry {
        padding: 24px 20px;
      }

      .bb-name {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .bb-flags p,
      .bb-why {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .ed-title {
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .ed-body {
        font-size: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
